            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I just realized that doing this will screw up the autocomplete for the rest of the nvim API (like for example, `vim.api.nvim_buf_set_lines()`). \r\n\r\n<img width=\"639\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/95201/3868fc6f-bc8d-45b0-8eba-dbb9eae5e7ca\">\r\n\r\n\r\nI wonder if there is a way to append to the workspace library settings 🤔 ",
